{"id": "CAT-D-001", "kind": "D", "context": "Catalog", "title": "Archive instead of delete", "text": "Choice: an archived product stays in the database, hidden from the catalogue listing.\nWhy: past orders and diagrams must stay readable.\nRejected: hard delete (breaks history); restore limited in time (no demand).\nLinks: CAT-RM-004, CAT-CU-02, CAT-CU-03", "status": "specified", "level": null, "path": "docs/business/Catalog/decisions.md", "line": 3, "end": 7, "cites": ["CAT-CU-02", "CAT-CU-03", "CAT-RM-004"], "usecases": ["CAT-CU-02", "CAT-CU-03"], "handlers": ["ArchiveProductCommandHandler", "RestoreProductCommandHandler"], "cited_by": ["ADR-001"], "contexts": ["Catalog"]}
{"id": "CAT-RM-001", "kind": "RM", "context": "Catalog", "title": "A product is visible only to its organisation", "text": "Outcome: a product of another organisation is reported as not found, `ProductNotFoundException`, never as forbidden.", "status": "specified", "level": null, "path": "docs/business/Catalog/rules.md", "line": 3, "end": 5, "cites": [], "usecases": ["CAT-CU-01", "CAT-CU-02", "CAT-CU-03"], "handlers": ["ArchiveProductCommandHandler", "GetProductQueryHandler", "ListCatalogueQueryHandler", "RestoreProductCommandHandler"], "cited_by": ["CAT-CU-01", "CAT-CU-02", "CAT-CU-03"], "contexts": ["Catalog"]}
{"id": "CAT-RM-004", "kind": "RM", "context": "Catalog", "title": "An archived product is absent from the catalogue listing", "text": "Outcome: the listing returns published products only; an archived product stays readable by its id.", "status": "specified", "level": null, "path": "docs/business/Catalog/rules.md", "line": 6, "end": 7, "cites": [], "usecases": ["CAT-CU-01", "CAT-CU-02", "CAT-CU-03"], "handlers": ["ArchiveProductCommandHandler", "GetProductQueryHandler", "ListCatalogueQueryHandler", "RestoreProductCommandHandler"], "cited_by": ["ADR-001", "CAT-CU-01", "CAT-CU-02", "CAT-CU-03", "CAT-D-001"], "contexts": ["Catalog"]}
{"id": "CAT-CU-01", "kind": "CU", "context": "Catalog", "title": "Consult products", "text": "A user of an organisation reads one of its products or browses its catalogue listing.\n\n## Rules\n\nAlso applies: CAT-RM-001, CAT-RM-004.", "status": "specified", "level": null, "path": "docs/business/Catalog/usecases/CAT-CU-01-consult-products.md", "line": 1, "end": 15, "cites": ["CAT-RM-001", "CAT-RM-004"], "usecases": ["CAT-CU-01"], "handlers": ["GetProductQueryHandler", "ListCatalogueQueryHandler"], "cited_by": [], "contexts": ["Catalog"]}
